===Proper noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{lb|en|Islam}} A son of [[Ali]] and brother of [[Hassan]]; a [[martyr]], and [[Shiah]] [[Imam]].
# {{given name|lang=en|male|from=Arabic}} used by [[Muslim]]s, diminutive of Hasan {{m|ar|حسن}} meaning ''[[good]]'' or ''[[handsome]]''.
# {{surname|lang=en|[[Muslim]]|from=Arabic|dot=}} derived from the {{etyl|ar|en}} given name.

